Package: WaDorule
Title: Derived State-Dependent Reservoir Release Policies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(
        person(
            given = "Peter",
            family = "Wasswa",
            email = "waswapeter4@gmail.com",
            role = c("aut", "cre")
        ),
        person(
            given = "Martin",
            family = "Doyle",
            role = "ctb",
            comment = "Supervisor"
        )
    )
Description: Provides a water-balance algorithm for deriving reservoir-specific
    daily release targets from user-supplied inflows, storage targets,
    elevation targets, and reservoir-specific storage and release constraints.
    The algorithm is designed for heterogeneous reservoirs and does not
    require reservoir-specific data to be embedded in the package.
